{"hookSpecificOutput": {"hookEventName": "PreToolUse", "permissionDecision": "deny", "permissionDecisionReason": "dangerous-ops-guard [system-destroy]: recursive chmod 000 locks you out of every file under the target. Use a narrower mode or drop -R. [command-sha256:dcd706671ccc314738cb32b4d060fdef7f6270c78f3d270fca766ec7a33ab91f] If you truly intend this, run it in a shell outside the harness, or update harness/hooks/lib/dangerous_ops_guard.py to exempt the pattern."}}
